	(text "Current sense:\n750 * 182 = 136500 uV/A (from efuse datasheet)\nWith the 12 bit ADC on the STM, we have a resolution of ~6mA\n\nCurrent limit:\n3334/Ilim (A) = R_{ILM}\nAt 3A, R_{ILM} = 1.11kR\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 208.534 84.836 0)
		(effects
